From 0a5464c3d5580e703f2d40c203a26ade5b222c9b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: faycal <faycalelhandi9@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 21:20:42 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 28/35] feat(hybrid): opt-in DLSS Super Resolution for the
 game's temporal upscale (blocked)

ASTROHYBRID_DLSS=1 with a KYTY_NGX_SDK_DIR build replaces Astro Bot's
temporal upscale draw with NGX DLSS using the game's own colour, depth,
motion vectors and jitter. NGX's Vulkan path needs VK_NVX_binary_import,
whose CUDA backing cannot reserve its address window in this process
(the PS5 memory map holds it), so device creation fails with the
extension and DLSS reports unavailable without it. ASTROHYBRID_DLSS_PROBE
and ASTROHYBRID_DLSS_SKIP_EXT are the diagnostics used to establish it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
